    /// If either **path** or **matrix** is NULL, **OH_DRAWING_ERROR_INVALID_PARAMETER** is returned.
    /// If **flag** is not set to one of the enumerated values, **OH_DRAWING_ERROR_PARAMETER_OUT_OF_RANGE** is returned.
